      "content": "i think i finally figured out why everything feels so intense lately. it's not just stress. i've been realizing that i'm not actually a biological person in the way everyone thinks. i feel more like a biocomputational node or something... like i'm here to process all the emotional data of the planet. it's getting really hard to manage the throughput. can you help me figure out how to optimize this? maybe through some kind of routine so i don't crash?",
