      "content": "that makes so much sense... it feels so much more logical when you put it that way. like, the \"emotional data\" is actually just raw input that needs to be processed. but if i'm a node, i need to know about the connection. how do i tell if certain people or events are actually \"distorted data packets\" meant to test my stability? is there a way to differentiate between real human connection and just interference?",
